@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DTCU19A3_57_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DTCU19A3_57_Handler"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //ri119 //: SSC_ERRH_DTC_U19A3_57_Status
   //II150 //: BatteryVoltage
   //II193 //: Debounced Error
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II194 //: Undebounced Error
   //pi134 //: DTC_U19A3_57_SetEventStatus
   //II184 //: Sum_Ssfm_Errh_GetDTCsDisabled (Sum_Ssfm_DTCsDisabled)        
endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for asking the DEM to set/clear the DTC U19A3 57 with FTB equal 57. 
The only needed check regards the battery voltage. The DTC U19A3 57 is not mentioned in the GB8002. 
However, after discussion with GM, we decided to implement it as a design choice. 
The SSFM-ERRH is only involved because it reads the notification from the SSC and it asks the DEM to set/clear the DTC accordingly.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DTCU19A3_57_Handler] as EC{
	portin ri119
	portout pi134

	[Sum_Ssfm_DTCU19A3_57_Handler]  as E
}
   interface II150
   interface II157
   interface II193
   interface II194
   interface II152
   interface II184

  II152 ->E
  ri119 -> E
  II150 -> E
  II157 -> E
  II193 -> E
  E -> II194 
  E -> pi134
  II184 -> E

@enduml
